            { heading: 'Infrastructure',         body: 'Age, layout, and condition of assets directly shape what improvements are feasible.' },
            { heading: 'Operational Conditions', body: 'Current performance, staffing capacity, and data availability define the starting point.' },
            { heading: 'Available Resources',    body: 'Budgetary and human resources determine the scope and sequence of improvements.' },
            { heading: 'Regulatory Environment', body: 'Compliance requirements and reporting obligations inform priorities and timelines.' },
