      <div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm border-l-4 border-primary-500">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-5">Scope and Professional Boundaries</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          EWOF supports operational assessment, prioritization, documentation, implementation planning, performance verification, and learning. It complements the utility's existing authority, procedures, technical resources, and professional responsibilities.
        </p>
