          EWOF does not replace regulatory obligations, water-quality or safety requirements, cybersecurity controls, or professional engineering judgment. Engineering design, licensed services, system installation, regulatory approval, cybersecurity work, and other regulated or specialized activities must be performed or approved by appropriately qualified and authorized professionals.
